SUMMARY:AMERSA 50th Annual Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The 50th AMERSA Annual Conference is held November 12 to 14\,
  2026 in Washington\, DC with preconference activities on November 11. T
 he theme is Stronger Together: Transforming Challenge into Opportunity i
 n Substance Use Care.\n\nDeadlines\nSubmission site opens: 2026-02-01\nA
 bstract submission: 2026-04-01\nWorkshop proposal submission: 2026-04-01
 \nDeadline to accept workshop invitation: 2026-05-15\nConference scholar
 ship award application: 2026-05-17\nDeadline to accept abstract invitati
 on: 2026-06-15\nEarly registration: 2026-08-31\nHotel room block: 2026-1
 0-01\n\nhttps://conference.amersa.org/
LOCATION:Washington\, District of Columbia\, Omni Shoreham Hotel
URL:https://conference.amersa.org/
